redirector-reliability

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Stop the redirector extension from crashing when NEAppProxyFlow calls its open completion handler twice, keep its lifecycle log at a level macOS persists, and name the fork distinctly from the stock app in System Settings.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream guards NEAppProxyFlow.open against a repeated completion and logs the provider lifecycle at notice level, and the fork no longer ships beside the stock redirector.
